America's Test Kitchen reports that

7
00:00:13,054 --> 00:00:14,262
ice soaks up smells.

8
00:00:14,442 --> 00:00:16,062
Freezer air, kept at 0°F,

9
00:00:16,062 --> 00:00:18,006
